  "justification": "Checked by episode title against TVDB series 247836 and TMDB show 44314. AniDB S1 \"放送直前スペシャル! 30分で分かる『DOG DAYS』!\" (Summary Season 1&2) is TMDB S0E6 \"Recap\" and has no TVDB episode (its default TVDB S0E1 is \"Summary of the Week #01\", another item); AniDB S2-S6 (\"リモーネリゾート・展望温泉!\" (Limone Resort Outlook Hot Spring!) to \"グラビアトーク~遠征組編 (遠征男子組)\" (Gravure Talk 4: Expedition Team Chapter - Men`s Expedition Team)) are TVDB S0E27 \"Limone Resort Tenbou Onsen!\" to TVDB S0E31 \"Gravure Talk #04 - Expedition Team Chapter - Men`s Expedition Team\" and TMDB S0E1 \"リモーネリゾート・展望温泉！\" (Limone Resort Tenbou Onsen!) to TMDB S0E5 \"Gravure Talk: xpedition Team Chapter - Men's Expedition Team\"; AniDB S7-S22 (\"キャスト座談会\" (Cast Roundtable) to \"今週のあらすじ #12\" (Summary of the Week 12)) have no TVDB episode (their defaults are other items). S1, a 25-minute recap of the first two seasons, is TMDB's only recap (S0E6 'Recap', 24 minutes, 2015-01-11).",
